                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "8/10. \n\nThis is the best Stronghold for me. It's set in medieval Europe unlike the Crusader versions so it's better. The combat and siege are all fun but that's not all! You can build a nice stronghold and small villages from scratch. Stronghold 2 also has unique mechanics such as \"crime\" which lets you choose a torture/execution method for the criminals while you watch it. It executes the castle life simulation perfectly. \n\nThe campaign(s) are cartoony and meh overall. Sometimes the game crashes randomly and you gotta do some modding to solve it. It's still a near perfect strategy game.",
